s=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:1186px;max-width: 1=
00%;" src=3D"7d6ee3e834cdbf41a1e1df2bffc07b35164d43656ec0ca601827a5520217c6=
89" height=3D"479"></span></p>
