=3D"#e6fcff">
         <ul title=3D"">
          <li data-uuid=3D"7c6386cb-e244-44ba-9c30-5f3c95c008a5">Single ord=
er entry</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#e6fcff"><br></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>User Pain Points</p></th>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffecf8">
         <ul title=3D"">
          <li data-uuid=3D"08dc97f4-7293-4113-897d-d410caf6673d">Parent use=
rs need multiple CX ID's to access each firm and have to choose one to link=
 R2 / SZ</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"00a5f92a-7e26-4602-a080-f03f4b0b8cba">Users need=
 multiple R2 ID's if their firms do not belong in the same broker code (edg=
e)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"32b580fb-9259-4b64-8233-55a5f4d91395">Users are =
sometimes unclear which ID has access to which RR's (observed inconsistenci=
es during user clean-up)</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffecf8">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"11eef4c9-8e57-4086-b69b-9f38f1f58338"><span styl=
e=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Must have multiple CX logins to use CX Account=
s, likely detracting Accounts adoption esp. when account docs are introduce=
d</span></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"116ff7b6-f70e-45e2-80db-a06abb288607">Potential =
multiple R2 and SZ logins if firms did not setup "sub-advisor" RR's or have=
 firms across broker codes - in this case only 1 can be linked to CX and us=
er continues to require direct login to the second</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5244203e-8da7-4c42-bd17-bd58fcaf35f5">:question:=
&nbsp;Inform RR controls</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1fc2e3de-2ae1-432b-b74d-4a4a6abe624f">No enforce=
d correlation in feature permissions across CX and R2 means user can have a=
ccounts actions in one platform but not the other</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3b5c27a7-f307-44c8-88a5-a0df7183a3df">In SOMA, u=
sers use multiple ID's to perform approvals for their child firms</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffecf8">
         <p>In addition to client servicing frictions,&nbsp;</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3ef7ec54-6dc3-49b8-b892-5bb380cc954f">NR can be =
inconsistent with the other platforms since it is also separately configure=
d</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffecf8">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"edba27ec-8430-440b-a1d8-245dc5bdd730">Multiple C=
X or R2 ID's required to retrieve datasets&nbsp;</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"6c3a77fb-53e8-4bd9-9bac-a7f0de6932c1">File gener=
ation is based on firm not parent requiring multiple downloads</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Business Frictions</p></th>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffecf8">
         <ul title=3D"">
          <li data-uuid=3D"11d36474-3265-4806-8530-bc53b58569c7">
           <p>No login traceability across systems to keep track of individ=
uals at firms - high tirage efforts during launch and support (multi-month =
analysis and outreach for launch)</p></li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffecf8">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c71984ef-6ac5-4751-a278-6c63f878da53">Relationsh=
ip unclear in R2 / SZ&nbsp;between hierarchal vs. sub-advisor when reviewin=
g user setup data</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"9e4dcaf9-964f-43c8-9ca8-7cb170f51088">Users with=
 multiple ID's cannot be accurately and uniquely identified across platform=
s</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"305e890b-47a7-473e-b9da-8c233283734a">Unclear if=
 user has greater feature permissions in 1 child firm, whether this is the =
case in the other</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffecf8">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"33ed9a0f-bc2f-4b5a-b81d-1c32e6388c8e">MF permiss=
ion in NR uncorrelated with MF upload permission in R2 and no enforcement</=
li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"6fa340f5-b909-4ffa-871e-5b4023d5288d">No RR enfo=
rcement across firms in NR - high data breach risk particularly for individ=
uals moving between firms and offboarding not handled correctly</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#ffecf8 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffecf8">
         <p title=3D""><br></p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Opportunities</p></th>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#e3fcef">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f7d5d721-b9a9-43a9-ba40-4f8840705b3a">Unified lo=
gin in CX that can link to downstream platforms</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#e3fcef">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"7f3e3a38-bc3e-45a1-8a68-c0eac25768cd">Parent-lev=
el users with access to RR ranges on both sides under single ID</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"7a6b54da-d953-47be-8abd-12f546b0606f">Parent-lev=
el feature permission definition</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f72e542e-05b3-4675-921a-245a6fd75fa6">RR sync ac=
ross CX / R2 / SZ</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"112f4b36-3f59-488b-8dcb-627ec821caba">Feature ac=
cess sync across CX / R2</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#e3fcef">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a9897cff-3238-4b0e-9034-a036f62c0107">Replace Ne=
tRep</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4334f5c3-e801-4f25-b142-a0927bcb2324">Re-visit R=
R enforcement for CX file upload design</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#e3fcef">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e9e092d7-d0c0-4dbb-af21-be9b4cce77e5">IIS / data=
 tools inherit new CX parent structure when introduced</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Constraints &amp; Considerations</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a959b0cb-9b09-4a90-b6c9-74c393da45b3">Introducin=
g CX cross-firm access introduces discrepancy in R2 access for cross-broker=
 scenario</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a3276d98-27ec-4f5c-adf6-61fe60cb25af">:question:=
 Need to verify if SZ and NetRep has same R2 issue</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"68275847-aeab-4dac-aa62-9ddc79c99459">R2 issue e=
xpected to be resolved with sunsetting of R2</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c40c4f8a-a9cc-4865-9725-52211bb71ed2">CX will no=
t allow cross-firm RR in basket and TA file uploads until this is resolved<=
/li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3d8e578e-7881-4914-b67b-8b86240a1e8c">NR as a st=
andalone issue expected to be resolved with CX trading</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b50097f7-f738-4b3f-a1c0-b2f516397a8d">:question:=
 Can legacy SZ apps such as Web Panagon support cross-firm context?</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Sub-advisor issues</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"e9fb79eb-6a3b-4e49-a705-fc0ce24e9bb6">
      <p>No formal firm context enforcement in legacy systems - a user can =
easily by assigned another firm's RR by mistake</p></li>
    </ul>
